<title>NORWAY: SOCCER-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from group B of the women's</p>
<p>European soccer championship on Sunday:</p>
<p>    Norway    0     Italy    2   (halftime 0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers: Carolina Morace 4, 89</p>
<p>    Denmark   0     Germany  2   (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Monika Meyer 82, Birgit Prinz 89</p>
<p>    Standings	    P  W  D  L   F   A  PTS</p>
<p> Italy		     3  1  2  0   5   3    5</p>
<p> Germany		   3  1  2  0   3   1    5</p>
<p> Norway		    3  1  1  1   5   2    4</p>
<p> Denmark		   3  0  1  2   2   9    1</p>
</text>
